1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,310
What kind of shopping does the writer enjoy,
你认为作者喜欢什么样的购物？

2
00:00:15,310 --> 00:00:19,240
What kind of shopping does the writer enjoy,
你认为作者喜欢什么样的购物？

3
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:20,100
do you think?
你知道吗？

4
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:27,580
'Do you call that a hat?' I said to my wife.
“你把那个叫帽子吗？”我对妻子说。

5
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:31,190
'You needn't be so rude about it,'
“你说话不必这么粗鲁，”

6
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:34,750
my wife answered as she looked at herself in the mirror.
妻子一边照镜子一边回答。

7
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:41,610
I sat down on one of those modern chairs with holes in it and waited.
我在那些有洞的现代椅子上坐下来等着。

8
00:00:42,860 --> 00:00:49,630
We had been in the hat shop for half an hour and my wife was still in front of the mirror.
我们在帽子店已经待了半个小时，妻子还站在镜子前面。

9
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:56,090
'We mustn't buy things we don't need,' I remarked suddenly.
“我们不该买不需要的东西，”我突然说。

10
00:00:56,870 --> 00:00:59,820
I regretted saying it almost at once.
我几乎立刻就后悔说了这话。

11
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:05,010
'You needn't have said that,' my wife answered.
“你本来不必说这话的，”妻子回答说。

12
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:11,120
'I needn't remind you of that terrible tie you bought yesterday.'
“我不必提醒你昨天买的那条难看的领带。”

13
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:15,670
'I find it beautiful,' I said.
“我觉得它很好看，”我说。

14
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:19,170
'A man can never have too many ties.'
“男人的领带越多越好。”

15
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:24,630
'And a woman can't have too many hats,' she answered.
“女人的帽子也是越多越好，”她回答。

16
00:01:26,390 --> 00:01:29,820
Ten minutes later we walked out of the shop together.
十分钟后我们一起走出了商店。

17
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:35,260
My wife was wearing a hat that looked like a lighthouse!
我妻子戴着一顶像灯塔一样的帽子！
